{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Math Drills Mental Arithmetic 是一款為學生與家長而設的心算練習工具，透過每日短時間的速算訓練，逐步建立更快的運算反應。題庫涵蓋加、減、乘、除四則運算，並按程度編排合適的練習組合，無需註冊帳戶即可開始。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線練習與錯題記錄</h2>\n<p>練習數據以離線優先方式儲存在裝置之上，無需登入、不設追蹤，也不會顯示廣告。每次作答後，錯題會自動收錄於錯題本，方便重新檢視；練習紀錄與清晰統計則讓學生與家長掌握進度變化。此外，使用者可解鎖成就，亦可自建題目組合，用於功課或考試準備。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-98-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-99-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-100-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-101-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-102-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Math Drills Mental Arithmetic</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T21:38:52.516539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}